{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996710/extras/BlinkingAndWinking_HEADER.gif?t=1744048087\" />Hold either one of the mouse buttons down to blink or wink, thus changing and interacting with your surroundings. The buttons on your mouse act as your character\u2019s eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996710/extras/SpecialGlasses_Demo.png?t=1744048087\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SPECIAL GLASSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a spectacular world where sight is everything and nothing is as it seems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Spectacle you switch between glasses that enable you to look at the world in different ways to solve the puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996710/extras/MindBending_Demo.png?t=1744048087\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MIND BENDING PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore mind-twisting puzzles where observation, spatial reasoning, and line of sight are your best tools.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996710/extras/AbstractSpaces_HEADER.gif?t=1744048087\" />Trip Space is a surreal universe where parallel spaces, perspective changes, and match cuts dictate how you perceive the world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2996710?t=1744048087","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2996710?t=1744048087","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996710/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744048087","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996710/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744048087","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996710/extras/BlinkingAndWinking_HEADER.gif?t=1744048087\" />Hold either one of the mouse buttons down to blink or wink, thus changing and interacting with your surroundings. The buttons on your mouse act as your character\u2019s eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996710/extras/SpecialGlasses_Demo.png?t=1744048087\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SPECIAL GLASSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a spectacular world where sight is everything and nothing is as it seems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Spectacle you switch between glasses that enable you to look at the world in different ways to solve the puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996710/extras/MindBending_Demo.png?t=1744048087\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MIND BENDING PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore mind-twisting puzzles where observation, spatial reasoning, and line of sight are your best tools.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996710/extras/AbstractSpaces_HEADER.gif?t=1744048087\" />Trip Space is a surreal universe where parallel spaces, perspective changes, and match cuts dictate how you perceive the world.</p>","developers":["Half Past Yellow"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2700150","name":"Spectacle"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"descripti